    "jaya nandanandana,    gopījana[FLAG_HYPHEN_ALPHA]ballabha,",
    "rādhānāyaka nāgara śyāma",
    "so śacīnandana,    nadīyā[FLAG_HYPHEN_ALPHA]purandara,",
